# Autorag's *app* needs no secrets to run.
#
# See `.env.example` for the Supabase values, which live in `.env` and are used
# by tooling rather than by the app. This file stays about the web app.
#
# The app is fully client-side: embeddings are computed in the browser with
# transformers.js, the index lives in IndexedDB, and the calling agent is the
# generation layer. No server, no API key, no data leaving the device — that is
# the architectural claim, not an accident of configuration.
#
# Everything below is optional and currently unused. Copy to .env.local only if
# one of these situations actually arises.

# Only needed if the token benchmark (webmcp-devtools-takeaways.md §3) is un-cut.
# Build-time measurement only; never read by the deployed app.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Only needed if the Hugging Face CDN rate-limits model downloads during the build.
# HF_TOKEN=

# Only needed if something server-side ever needs the canonical origin.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://autorag.vercel.app
